  "translate_en|mods/HydeCoFrogs/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_HydeCoFrogs": "HydeCo. Frogs!",
  "translate_en|mods/HydeCoFrogs/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_HydeCoFrogs_Frogs": "Frogs",
  "translate_en|mods/HydeCoFrogs/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_HydeCoFrogs_FrogsNearPlayer": "Most frogs out at once",
  "translate_en|mods/HydeCoFrogs/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_HydeCoFrogs_FrogsNearPlayer_tooltip": "How many frogs can be out around each player at the same time (4 by default). Lower it to see fewer, raise it for more. 0 stops new frogs coming out.",
  "translate_en|mods/HydeCoFrogs/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_HydeCoFrogs_Frogs_tooltip": "Green and brown frogs live by lily pads on ponds, creeks and rivers. Near water there is always at least one frog on the bank. More frogs come out from spring to autumn, in the evening, at night and in the rain. A frog that sees you leaps into the water and sinks. Sneaking lets you get closer. Frogs can be picked up, and a dead frog gives a whole frog.",
  "translate_en|mods/HydeCoFrogs/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_HydeCoFrogs_PrepareToRemove": "Prepare to Remove Mod",
  "translate_en|mods/HydeCoFrogs/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_HydeCoFrogs_PrepareToRemove_tooltip": "Removing this mod from a game where a frog was out at the last save loses the other animals saved around it, your own included. In single player, save once with this version (sleep, or quit), after letting go of any you carry and it should be safe to remove. On a server, turn this on first: no frogs come out and any that are out go home; let the server save, then remove the mod."
